{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>זנית</b> — defective [spelling] without vav, like <b>שמש ירח עמד זבלה</b>. The sense: both prostitution and wine, each of them takes the heart — and the taking of the heart is as though they remain without heart to understand."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:05.134707891Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}